# (build 145) The doctor's portrait (portrait 10, the picture doctor) in
# Paseo's hospital (Building_Hospital), from its picture: one of the
# twelve pictures no route drew after build 142, so colour_check had never
# held it to its tiles. Build 146 deletes the tiles' loader; this route is
# part of what proves the pictures alone draw the same frames. In through
# the door's own bytes (building 4, portrait 10, the price row 8), HEAL and
# CURE, B, the goodbye, and the fade out to the street with the portrait up.

start building 4 10 8 0 15 22       # the hospital; the street is 15,22
wait idle
expect script $0501                 # "May I help you?"
expect picture 56 64 doctor
shot 01_doctor
press b
wait idle
expect script $0505
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 15 22
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
